    <h2>Other Options &amp; Safety Net</h2>
    <p class="lede">These are secondary paths &mdash; backstops, or programs that apply only at 65+, with a disability, or after leaving a W-2 job. They are not substitutes for real coverage, but they matter in a gap year or a coverage transition.</p>
